un cadre externalis\u00e9 et s\u00e9curis\u00e9, garantissant conformit\u00e9 juridique, gestion administrative simplifi\u00e9e et continuit\u00e9 op\u00e9rationnelle.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-15944bd elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"15944bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n\t\t\t\tComp\u00e9tences cl\u00e9s d\u2019un consultant en cybers\u00e9curit\u00e9 performant\t\t\t\t<\/h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad3753b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ad3753b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1298\">Un consultant en cybers\u00e9curit\u00e9 doit combiner des comp\u00e9tences techniques, strat\u00e9giques et organisationnelles :<\/p><ul data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1881\"><li data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1367\"><p data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1367\">Analyse des vuln\u00e9rabilit\u00e9s et gestion des risques informatiques<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1442\"><p data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1442\">Conception et mise en \u0153uvre de politiques de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 et de conformit\u00e9<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1505\"><p data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1505\">D\u00e9tection et r\u00e9ponse aux incidents de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 (SOC, SIEM)<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"1506\" da